ngs to make use  of here you can now use iron sights on  all weapons but more importantly the  game remembers which gun you have in  third person and which guns in first  person so with a little prep work at the  start of each round you can get your  precision guns and iron sights and your  smgs and panic weapons in third person  that way you can adapt to situations  quickly such as how you definitely want  to be in third person inside of  buildings to see what's around you don't  forget that in third person you can  shoulder swap and you should always  round corners from the correct side  there's also now an active reload  mechanic that you have to pay attention  to especially in the middle of a loud  firefight make sure to nail the reload  quickly but also remember it's still  usually faster to go to another weapon  these levels are massive i may said this  a bunch of times already and there's a  lot of ways through them and items to  find like weapon benches and caches keys  crowbars and explosives these items let  you customize weapons get into locked  chests and open up new routes across the  map give yourself permission it's okay  to fudge your first run and get around  quickly to learn where these things are  before pulling off that sweet stealth  run another advantage is that although  you will unlock some items through play  you need to find weapon benches to open  up certain gun attachments like the  suppressor for your starting sniper  rifle  invasions can be confusing at first  especially if you're the one being  invaded this is where another player  enters your game as one of the enemy  soldiers and tries to take you out  unlike dark souls you're not going to  know who this enemy player is they don't  have like a tint or anything like that  if you're invaded stop playing against  the environment and focus all of your  energy on hunting that other player down  you're at a huge disadvantage if you try  to manage both the level objectives and  the playerve