rks out  so that should get you started with  sniper elite 5. what's something that  surprised you in the game and what's  something fun you learned that other  players could use these were just our  initial experiences let us know in the  comments below we cover a ton of first  person and third person shooters so join  us over on gamespot and gamespot's  youtube page thanks for watching  [Music]  you

